        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dear Sara,</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">I would like to introduce you to my colleague Peng Wang, PhD candidate at our Educational Sciences team.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Peng would like to start a new multidisciplinary study of three weeks with a 100 up to 200 participants. Peng and his colleagues are in the recruitment phase of this study and depending on the success of the recruitment they will start in the coming months. For this study they may use the EUR credits for their data-collection, but I am not sure if we have enough credits left this year? </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thanks in advance,</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Petra</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p>Petra Olsthoorn</p>\n<p>Project Manager</p>\n<p><b>Rotterdam ESM Group</b></p>\n<p><span><br>\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0998ef;\">E</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:olsthoorn@essb.eur.nl\"><span style=\"color:windowtext;\">olsthoorn@essb.eur.nl</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0998ef;\">T</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> +31 10 408 9927<br>\n<b><span style=\"color:#0998ef;\">Visiting address</span></b><span style=\"color:#0998ef;\">\n</span>Mandeville Building | Room T13-54</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Burgemeester Oudlaan 50 | 3062 PA Rotterdam</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Follow us </span><b><span style=\"color:#0998ef;\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rotterdam-esm-group/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rotterdam-esm-group/\" target=\"_blank\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0998ef;\">on LinkedIn</span></a></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#33e1ab;\"><a href=\"https://www.eur.nl/en/essb/research/research-themes/research-methods/measuring-daily-life\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.eur.nl/en/essb/research/research-themes/research-methods/measuring-daily-life\" target=\"_blank\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:windowtext;\">Visit </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#33e1ab;\">our website</span></a></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#33e1ab;\"></span></b></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><img border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:100%;width:1.2152in;max-height:1.2152in;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/26102/79907/134954?view=inline\"></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>",
